  unitName: Mad God Zebra
  unitId: 60234
  unitNumber: 317
  description: Zebra, disciple of Cardes the Malevolent, in his true form. An incredibly
    ominous creature whose heartless attacks struck fear in the hearts of those he
    fought during the great war in which the gods destroyed the humans. He's often
    mistaken for a death god because of how he harvests the souls of his victims
    with his right hand after slaying them with the sword in his left, but he very
    much hates this, sending any who dare address him so to a tragic end.
  summonDesc: How curious that you should<br>summon me in my true form.<br>I shall
    accompany you for a while.
  fusionDesc: I can feel the energy<br>filling me from the inside.<br>I feel my true
    power returning...
  evoDesc: I'm back to my true form.<br>But you better be prepared.<br>I can erase
    you at any time.
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
